-- The disability pension is cited to chapter ו2, which the consolidation does not contain.
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: reg 1(4)(ב) of the Exemption Regulations to NII chapter ו2, the disability pension`)
#ASSERT (`reference: reg 1(4)(ב) of the Exemption Regulations to NII chapter ו2, the disability pension`)'s `the target is printed under the name the citing words use in the consolidation` EQUALS TRUE

§ `P4: the Hebrew date and the Gregorian date of the cited day do not agree`

-- 14 Adar 5761 is 9 March 2001; 1 March 2001 is 6 Adar 5761.
#ASSERT `the two dates name the same day` (`date pair: the instruction gives 14 Adar 5761 and 1 March 2001 for one day`)
